window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-d6f4398aa4652d7e"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"chatgpt-desktop-app\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"chatgpt\">ChatGPT 桌面应用</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档目录见 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面的 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"chatgpt-desktop-app_1\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"chatgpt_1\">ChatGPT 桌面应用</h2> <p>在一个桌面工作区中并行运行项目、处理文件、使用电脑，并持续推进长时间运行的工作。</p> <p><a id=\"why-use-the-desktop-app\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_1\">为什么使用桌面应用</h3> <ul> <li><strong>随时查看所有对话：</strong> 在项目和长时间运行的任务之间切换，同时保留上下文。</li> <li><strong>创建并检查真实产出：</strong> 在同一工作区中打开文档、电子表格、图像和其他文件。</li> <li><strong>协同使用各种工具：</strong> 使用浏览器、桌面应用和插件，或在对话中安排任务。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"get-started-with-the-desktop-app\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">开始使用桌面应用</h2> <p>安装 ChatGPT 并登录，选择工作位置，然后发送第一条消息。</p> <ol> <li><strong>安装 ChatGPT 桌面应用。</strong> 对于 macOS 或 Windows，请<a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/download/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下载 ChatGPT（需联网）</a>；对于 Linux，请按照 <a href=\"#/article/a-8701a8c2ceb3943c\">Linux 安装指南</a>操作。</li> <li><strong>打开 ChatGPT 并登录。</strong> 打开应用，然后使用你的 ChatGPT 账户登录。</li> <li><strong>选择工作位置。</strong> 开始一段对话、创建项目或打开文件夹。ChatGPT 可以使用你所选位置中的文件和上下文。<a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">了解对话和项目</a>。</li> <li><strong>发送第一条消息。</strong> 选择 ChatGPT 或 Codex。在 ChatGPT 中，使用输入框上方的切换控件选择 Chat 或 Work。在 Codex 中，从“新建对话”开始。如果只是快速提问，将鼠标指向“新建对话”，然后选择其右侧的 <strong>Quick chat</strong>（快速对话）图标。接着说明你希望完成什么，并添加 ChatGPT 需要的文件或上下文。<a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f\">了解如何使用 ChatGPT</a>。</li> </ol> <p><a id=\"next-steps\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_3\">后续步骤</h3> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-8701a8c2ceb3943c\">在 Linux 上安装</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">使用项目整理工作</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">创建并检查文件</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">使用浏览器和电脑</a></li> </ul> <p><a id=\"see-what-the-app-can-do\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">查看应用的功能</h2> <p>把日常工作转化为可检查、可改进、可分享的成果。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-533036eaec307c04\">每天开始时生成一份聚焦的工作简报</a>：汇总日历、消息、电子邮件和项目上下文中的优先事项。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-99d1e8fe39794227\">分析文件并创建交互式可视化内容</a>：把数据导出内容转化为可检查、可分享的发现。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-c96f1de8b434cae9\">将零散的上下文整理成完整的 PRD</a>：汇总多个来源，提炼要点并形成可继续编辑的文档。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-2af90f80487bf1f4\">清理并准备混乱的数据</a>：生成一份整洁的 CSV 或电子表格副本，而不更改原文件。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-234061428b0929bd\">将反馈转化为后续行动</a>：汇总反馈并生成便于评审的结果。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"use-the-chatgpt-desktop-app-when\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"chatgpt_2\">适合使用 ChatGPT 桌面应用的场景</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">协调多个项目</a>：同时查看并行进行的工作，并在不同对话之间快速切换。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">创建并评审文件</a>：完成工作成果并在 ChatGPT 中直接检查，无需离开应用。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">使用浏览器和电脑</a>：为 ChatGPT 提供任务所需的工具访问能力。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68?anchor=schedule-a-task-inside-a-chat\">安排重复执行的工作</a>：创建独立的定时任务，或在现有对话中安排任务。</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"chatgpt-desktop-app\">ChatGPT desktop app</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"chatgpt-desktop-app_1\">ChatGPT desktop app</h2> <p>Run projects in parallel, work with files, use your computer, and keep long-running work moving from one desktop workspace.</p> <h3 id=\"why-use-the-desktop-app\">Why use the desktop app</h3> <ul> <li><strong>Keep every chat in view:</strong> Move between projects and long-running work without losing context.</li> <li><strong>Create and inspect real outputs:</strong> Open documents, spreadsheets, images, and other files in the same workspace.</li> <li><strong>Work across your tools:</strong> Use the browser, desktop apps, and plugins, or schedule a task inside a chat.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"get-started-with-the-desktop-app\">Get started with the desktop app</h2> <p>Install ChatGPT, sign in, choose where to work, and send your first message.</p> <ol> <li><strong>Install the ChatGPT desktop app.</strong> <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/download/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download ChatGPT (online)</a> for macOS or Windows, or follow the <a href=\"#/article/a-8701a8c2ceb3943c\">Linux installation guide</a>.</li> <li><strong>Open ChatGPT and sign in.</strong> Open the app, then sign in with your ChatGPT account.</li> <li><strong>Choose where to work.</strong> Start a chat, create a project, or open a folder. ChatGPT can use the files and context in the location you choose. <a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">Learn about chats and projects</a>.</li> <li><strong>Send your first message.</strong> Choose ChatGPT or Codex. In ChatGPT, use the toggle above the composer to select Chat or Work. In Codex, start with New chat. For a quick question, point to New chat and select the Quick chat icon on its right. Then describe the result you want and add any files or context ChatGPT needs. <a href=\"#/article/a-d6b5aa6a43ce8c0f\">Learn how to use ChatGPT</a>.</li> </ol> <h3 id=\"next-steps\">Next steps</h3> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-8701a8c2ceb3943c\">Install on Linux</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">Organize work with projects</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">Create and inspect files</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">Use the browser and your computer</a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"see-what-the-app-can-do\">See what the app can do</h2> <p>Turn everyday work into outputs you can review, refine, and share.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-533036eaec307c04\">Start each day with a focused work brief</a>: Review priorities across your calendar, messages, email, and project context.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-99d1e8fe39794227\">Analyze files and create interactive visuals</a>: Turn a data export into a finding you can inspect and share.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-c96f1de8b434cae9\">Turn scattered context into a finished PRD</a>: Bring sources together, synthesize them, and create a working document.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-2af90f80487bf1f4\">Clean and prepare messy data</a>: Turn a messy CSV or spreadsheet into a clean copy without changing the original.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-234061428b0929bd\">Turn feedback into actions</a>: Synthesize feedback from multiple sources into a reviewable artifact.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"use-the-chatgpt-desktop-app-when\">Use the ChatGPT desktop app when…</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">Coordinate several projects</a>: Keep parallel work visible and move between chats quickly.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">Create and review files</a>: Build finished work and inspect it without leaving ChatGPT.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">Use the browser and your computer</a>: Give ChatGPT access to the tools a task requires.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68?anchor=schedule-a-task-inside-a-chat\">Schedule recurring work</a>: Create a standalone scheduled task or schedule a task inside an existing chat.</li> </ul>"};
